## Goal
Show how the treated and untreated samples separate on a principal component analysis of the
gene-level counts. The analysis produces the sample coordinates on the leading principal
components, the variance each component explains, and a PC1-vs-PC2 scatter with samples
coloured by condition (treated / untreated), for the six samples A1-A3 (untreated) and B1-B3
(treated).

