| results/pca_pc1_pc2.pdf | figure | Same plot, vector format |

## Execution
Runs: batch
One job through the workspace executor (`_system/executorlib.py submit`), 1 CPU, 4 GB memory,
15-minute time limit. Expected wall time under 2 minutes (6 samples x ~200 genes). Expected
total output size under 1 MB.
